From d6fd62d39b5339a0520974aa78392e05b335411e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 16:33:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] Accept or decline the invitations of professionals in
 the app

Open invitations to the user's email address show on the follow-up card,
above the professionals and also when nobody follows the user yet: who
invites, the profession and the clinic, and the consent text of the web
app saying what accepting authorizes. "Accept and authorize" accepts with
the agreement the server records as consent; "Decline" ends the
invitation. The card reloads afterwards; a failed answer says so.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VRSTuUkoebWWM2DLbPZAvR
